<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Products</title>
    <!-- Google Fonts for premium typography -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Bootstrap -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background: #fff8fc;
            min-height: 100vh;
            color: #2d2430;
        }

        /* ===== MENÚ WOMEN SAFETY ===== */

        .navbar-women {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            padding: 16px 5%;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 15px rgba(90, 50, 80, 0.08);
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f3dce9;
        }

        .navbar-women .navbar-brand {
            color: #8e3a68;
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .navbar-women .navbar-brand:hover {
            color: #b34d83;
        }

        .navbar-women .nav-link {
    position: relative;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .navbar-women .nav-link:hover {
            color: #b34d83;
            background: #fbeaf3;
            border-radius: 20px;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .navbar-women .nav-link::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            left: 50%;
            bottom: 4px;
            width: 0;
            height: 2px;
            background: #b34d83;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
        }

        .navbar-women .nav-link:hover::after {
            width: 60%;
        }

        /* ===== PRESENTACIÓN ===== */

        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 100px 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #8e3a68;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero p {
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            color: #6f6470;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .hero-button {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            background: #8e3a68;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 25px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .hero-button:hover {
            background: #b34d83;
            color: white;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- Menú de navegación -->
<!-- Menú de navegación WOMEN SAFETY -->
<nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-women">
    <div class="container-fluid">

        <a class="navbar-brand" href="#inicio">
            ♀ WOMEN SAFETY
        </a>

        <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button"
                data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                data-bs-target="#menuPrincipal"
                aria-controls="menuPrincipal"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-label="Mostrar menú">
            <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
        </button>

        <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="menuPrincipal">
            <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto">

                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a class="nav-link" href="#inicio">Inicio</a>
                </li>

                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a class="nav-link" href="#servicios">Servicios</a>
                </li>

                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a class="nav-link" href="#ubicacion">Ubicación</a>
                </li>

                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a class="nav-link" href="#quienes-somos">
                        ¿Quiénes somos?
                    </a>
                </li>

            </ul>
        </div>

    </div>
</nav>
<section id="inicio" class="hero">

    <h1>Tu seguridad también importa.</h1>

    <p>
        WOMEN SAFETY es un espacio creado para brindar
        información, herramientas y recursos que ayuden
        a las mujeres a sentirse más seguras y acompañadas.
    </p>

    <a href="#slider" class="hero-button">
        Conoce nuestros servicios
    </a>

</section>

<%- include('partials/slider') %>

<!-- Bootstrap JavaScript -->
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
